"50e-6;\nCout = 3400e-6;            % 5 x 680 uF\nVo   = 400;  Pout = 4000;  R"
"load = Vo^2/Pout;\nfsw  = 100e3;\nTdel = 1/(2*fsw);\n\n% --- voltage (P_ref) "
"---\nfcv  = 3;                           % Hz\nKpv  = 2*pi*fcv*Cout*Vo;      "
"      % 25.6 W/V\nKiv  = Kpv*2*pi*fcv/5;              % 96.5\nwlp  = 2*pi*20;"
"                     % LPF (rad/s)\nPmax = 4500;\n\n% --- current ---\nfci  ="
" 10e3;                        % Hz\nKpi  = 2*pi*fci*Lb/Vo;              % 0.0"
"39\nKii  = Kpi*2*pi*fci/10;             % 247\n\n% --- curr ref ---\nKref = 1"
"/Vpk^2;   % i_ref = P_ref * |vin| * Kref"
